<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage eases to 9.13 bln rand.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage eases to 9.13 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank said the South African money market shortage fell slightly to 9.132 billion rand on Tuesday from 9.340 billion rand on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
